metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 148: the Electrokoopa on the ground (TElecNokonoko), Pinna Park's beach Koopa with the sparking blue shell. Drop it on the ground facing the way it should start (+Z is its front); it wanders (a Graph of Node3D children, or within WanderRadiusUnits). When it sees you it turns to you, runs at you and, within 27 m, SHOOTS its shell: the shell skids at you, zigzagging and spinning (it shocks you on touch, bounces off walls and other enemies), flies out about 20 m and comes back; the Koopa waits bare for it and puts it back on. Touching the shell on its back shocks you (-1 HP); the bare Koopa only bumps you -- stomp it then and it dies (one coin); it cannot be picked up (the game never lets you). The hose: with the shell on, a short stun; bare, it struggles until it grows a new shell. Hose it while its shell is coming home and the shell electrocutes it (a coin). Knobs: Deviations (SpeedScale, ReflectSw = the shell bounces off walls and enemies), Effects (the shell sparks, the stun, the head sparks, the change puff slots), Sounds (slots)."

